# Mirrors .gitignore, plus .git itself and IDE/editor cruft — none of
# this belongs in the build context. Most important entry is
# node_modules/: this repo is worked on from Windows, so a host
# node_modules (if present) carries Prisma's Windows query-engine binary
# and other native bindings that are simply wrong for the Linux build
# stage — `pnpm install` inside the image is what produces a correct one,
# and it must not find a pre-existing node_modules to (incorrectly) trust.
node_modules/
dist/
build/
generated/
*.tsbuildinfo
coverage/
*.log
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.DS_Store
.git/
.gitignore
.claude/
.vscode/
.idea/
